ote":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042-pei02-02","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042-pei02-02:m0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"承明","kind":"person","person_id":"pac_tt7_hs3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042-pei02-02","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line048:m0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"潘浚","kind":"person","person_id":"pac_tt7_hs3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line048","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-wu052-bz-23","person_id":"pac_tt7_hs3","title":"太常","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line102","quote":"又曰：丞相顧雍。上大將軍陸遜、太常潘浚，憂深責重，志在竭誠，夙夜兢兢，寢食不寧，念欲安國利民，建久長之計，可謂心膂股肱，社稷之臣矣。宜各委任，不使他官監其所司，責其成效，課其負殿。此三臣者，思慮不到則已，豈敢專擅威福欺負所天乎？","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line102:m0017"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-wu052-bz-23:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line102","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"太常","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line102:m0017","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"t-wu058-x34","person_id":"pac_tt7_hs3","kind":"office","title":"太常","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本句所載職官，任免時間未詳。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-058","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-058-luxun","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line048","quote":"六年，中郎將周祗乞於鄱陽召募，事下問遜。遜以為此郡民易動難安，不可與召。恐致賊寇。而祗固陳取之，郡民吳遽等果作賊殺祗，攻沒諸縣。豫章、廬陵宿惡民並應遽為寇。遜自聞，輒討即破，遽等相率降，遜料得精兵八千餘人，三郡平。時中書典校呂壹，竊弄權柄，擅作威福。遜與太常潘浚同心憂之，言至流涕。後權誅壹，深以自責，語在《權傳》。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line048:m0129"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu058-x34:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line048","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line048:m0129","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"太常","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line034:r0123","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line034","start":123,"end":124,"surface":"君","person_id":"pac_tt7_hs3","referent_role":"addressee","quote":"又奉國舊意。今君殺其子弟，若天","note":"依對話說話者、受書者及上下句定位。","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-ben"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line034","text":"　　鄰年九歲，代領豫章，近封都鄉侯。在郡垂二十年，討平叛賊，功績修理。召還武昌，為繞帳督。時太常潘浚掌荊州事，重安長陳留舒燮有罪下獄，浚嘗失燮，欲置之於法。論者多為有言，浚猶不釋。鄰謂浚曰：\"舒伯膺兄弟爭死，海內義之，以為美談，仲膺又奉國舊意。今君殺其子弟，若天下一統，青蓋北巡，中州士人必問仲膺繼嗣，答者雲潘承明殺燮，於事何如?\"浚意即解，燮用得濟。鄰遷夏口沔中督、威遠將軍，所居任職。赤烏十二年卒。子苗嗣。苗弟旅及叔父安、熙、績，皆歷列位。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line034:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"鄰","kind":"person","person_id":"8jx_b5c_t2q_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line034:m0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"潘浚","kind":"person","person_id":"pa