曰：丞相顧雍。上大將軍陸遜、太常潘浚，憂深責重，志在竭誠，夙夜兢兢，寢食不寧，念欲安國利民，建久長之計，可謂心膂股肱，社稷之臣矣。宜各委任，不使他官監其所司，責其成效，課其負殿。此三臣者，思慮不到則已，豈敢專擅威福欺負所天乎？","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line102:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"顧雍","kind":"person","person_id":"syc_ik6_bq5_**A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line102:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"陸遜","kind":"person","person_id":"lii_454_vuv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line102:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"潘浚","kind":"person","person_id":"pac_tt7_hs3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":102,"last_line":102,"revision_id":2085149,"raw_start":12854,"raw_end":12970,"character_positions":[12856,12857,12858,12859,12860,12861,12862,12863,12864,12865,12866,12867,12868,12869,12870,12871,12872,12873,12874,12875,12876,12877,12878,12879,12880,12881,12882,12883,12884,12885,12886,12887,12888,12889,12890,12891,12892,12893,12894,12895,12896,12897,12898,12899,12900,12901,12902,12903,12904,12905,12906,12907,12908,12909,12910,12911,12912,12913,12914,12915,12916,12917,12918,12919,12920,12921,12922,12923,12924,12925,12926,12927,12928,12929,12930,12931,12932,12933,12934,12935,12936,12937,12938,12939,12940,12941,12942,12943,12944,12945,12946,12947,12948,12949,12950,12951,12952,12953,12954,12955,12956,12957,12958,12959,12960,12961,12962,12963,12964,12965,12966,12967,12968,12969]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042-pei02-02","text":"徐众评曰：雍不以吕壹见毁之故，而和颜悦色，诚长者矣。然开引其意，问所欲道，此非也。壹奸险乱法，毁伤忠贤，吴国寒心，自太子登、陆逊已下，切谏不能得，是以潘濬欲因会手剑之，以除国患，疾恶忠主，义形於色，而今乃发起令言。若壹称枉邪，不申理，则非录狱本旨；若承辞而奏之，吴主傥以敬丞相所言，而复原宥，伯言、承明不当悲慨哉！怀叙本无私恨，无所为嫌，故詈辱之，疾恶意耳，恶不仁者，其为仁也。季武子死，曾点倚其门而歌；子晳创发，子产催令自裁。以此言之，雍不当责怀叙也。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042-pei02-02:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"徐众","kind":"person","person_id":"wod_cwr_976","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042-pei02-02:m0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"雍","kind":"person","person_id":"syc_ik6_bq5_**A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042-pei02-02:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"吕壹","kind":"person","person_id":"ym8_q7g_031","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042-pei02-02:m0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"壹","kind":"person","person_id":"ym8_q7g_031","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042-pei02-02:m0058","start":58,"end":61,"surface":"太子登","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba_C","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042-pei02-02:m0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"陆逊","kind":"person","person_id":"lii_454_vuv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042-pei02-02:m0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"潘濬","kind":"person","person_id":"pac_tt7_hs3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042-pei02-02:m0108","start":108,"end":109,"surface":"壹","kind":"person","person_id":"ym8_q7g_031","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042-pei02-02:m0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"吴主","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來